    "topic": "15 Distance Measuring Equipment (DME)",
    "subtopic": "Principle of Operation",
    "question": "A DME interrogator measures 2 520 µs between interrogation and reply. What is the slant range?",
    "options": [
      {
        "id": "a",
        "text": "About 200 NM"
      },
      {
        "id": "b",
        "text": "About 100 NM"
      },
      {
        "id": "c",
        "text": "About 408 NM"
      },
      {
        "id": "d",
        "text": "About 204 NM"
      }
    ],
    "correct": "a",
    "explanation": "Subtract the 50 µs delay: 2 470 µs. Divide by the radar mile: 2 470 / 12.36 ≈ 200 NM. Forgetting the delay gives about 204 NM.",
