    "topic": "15 Distance Measuring Equipment (DME)",
    "subtopic": "Principle of Operation",
    "question": "How does an aircraft's DME recognise the replies to its own interrogations?",
    "options": [
      {
        "id": "a",
        "text": "It accepts only the strongest reply"
      },
      {
        "id": "b",
        "text": "Each aircraft has its own reply frequency, set by its code"
